  "// CPU simulator (the same text compiles as MSL and as C).\n" ++
  "//\n" ++
  "// bendc compiles every function a !-call can reach into one flat state\n" ++
  "// machine: a frame per call, a case per block, `pc` the block to run. A\n" ++
  "// parallel let pushes its thunks to a lock-free queue and continues through\n" ++
  "// a join record, so a lane never blocks: whoever brings a join its last\n" ++
  "// value runs the continuation. Values are the CPU's words. The device reads\n" ++
  "// the CPU heap in place (unified memory) and builds new objects in an arena\n" ++
  "// the host copies the result out of. Anything the device cannot do (an\n" ++
  "// effect, a Nat past 2^63, a full arena or queue, a failed match, a closure\n" ++
